<title>ITALY: CYCLING-CIPOLLINI WINS SECOND STAGE OF GIRO D'ITALIA.</title>
<headline>CYCLING-CIPOLLINI WINS SECOND STAGE OF GIRO D'ITALIA.</headline>
<dateline>CERVIA, Italy 1997-05-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mario Cipollini of Italy won the 211-km second stage of the Giro d'Italia cycle race on Sunday, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Jan Svorada of the Czech Republic was second and Endrio Leoni of Italy third.</p>
<p>Cipollini retained the overall leader's pink jersey.</p>
</text>
